  "notes": "USAGE:\nMore formal and specific than {祈|いの}り (prayer in general). {祈願|きがん} typically involves visiting a shrine or temple and praying for a concrete wish or goal. Common occasions include exam success, safe childbirth, business prosperity, and traffic safety.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {合格|ごうかく}{祈願|きがん}: prayer for passing an exam\n- {安産|あんざん}{祈願|きがん}: prayer for safe childbirth\n- {商売|しょうばい}{繁盛|はんじょう}{祈願|きがん}: prayer for business prosperity\n- {交通|こうつう}{安全|あんぜん}{祈願|きがん}: prayer for traffic safety\n- {必勝|ひっしょう}{祈願|きがん}: prayer for certain victory",
